  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Politics and Society Institute</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to facilitate knowledge exchange between Norwegian experts in political reform and key stakeholders in Jordan, including professors, political party representatives, academic institutions, decision-makers, media, and other concerned parties. It also aims to exchange experiences between Norwegian and Jordanian youth so that Jordanian youth, especially those who are politically active, can learn from the Norwegian experience in political reform and transformation.

The project will be implemented over 12 months</narrative>
  </description>
